  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<h5><span class=\"mw-headline\"><i>THIS HAS BEEN OUTDATED FOR AROUND 5 YEARS. DO US A FAVOR AND RESEARCH THIS.</i></span></h5>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Holiday Calendar decorations</b></span></h3>\n<p><b>Holiday Calendar decorations</b> come as prizes when tapping special decorations on <a href=\"/wiki/greg-7538\" title=\"Greg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Greg</a>'s farm during certain seasonal celebrations.\n</p>\n<h4><span></span><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>2018 Winter Holidays (Gift Boxes)</b></span></h4>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AFishing_Hole.png\" title=\"Fishing Hole.png (232 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/1/16/Fishing_Hole.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20181223222000\" title=\"Fishing Hole.png (232 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Fishing Hole\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Fishing Hole.png (232 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Fishing Hole\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Fishing Hole</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AIce_Sheep.png\" title=\"Ice Sheep.png (277 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/d/d1/Ice_Sheep.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20181224155429\" title=\"Ice Sheep.png (277 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Ice Sheep\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Ice Sheep.png (277 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Ice Sheep\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Ice Sheep</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ASnow_Slope.png\" title=\"Snow Slope.png (183 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/fa/Snow_Slope.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20181223222026\" title=\"Snow Slope.png (183 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Snow Slope\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Snow Slope.png (183 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Snow Slope\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Snow Slope</div></div></div>\n<h4><span></span><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>2019 Halloween (Jack O' Lanterns)</b></span></h4>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AChicken_Fence.png\" title=\"Chicken Fence.png (24 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/21/Chicken_Fence.png/revision/latest?cb=20191023202303\" title=\"Chicken Fence.png (24 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Chicken Fence x5\" height=\"127\" width=\"127\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Chicken Fence.png (24 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\